{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act19mini_level_act19mini_st04",
  "groupId": "act19mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "白錦",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19mini/level_act19mini_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ab27bf9879bced9c14c95acd56c9a8eb48a44eb1b0bece0c47132751e330601c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g08_pavilion"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1642_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大哥，你到底下不下啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寡言的棋士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不急，讓我再想想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1642_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我看你想半天了，上次來你也在想，上上次也是，你是不是被什麼人騙了啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1642_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來這麼多回，從來沒見過對面有人和你下棋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寡言的棋士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會有錯的，我只是……在考慮後面的走法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寡言的棋士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "落子後對方的反應，以及之後所有變化，都要想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1642_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真麻煩，想想就頭痛……你就不能先把這局棋下完，然後再讓那個和你下棋的人教你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1642_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這只是一局棋，下輸了又不會發生什麼事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寡言的棋士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我不能輸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寡言的棋士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布下棋局的人承諾過，只要我贏了，就可以滿足我一個願望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1642_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個願望？真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1642_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，可惜我搞不懂這些繞來繞去的，可能還是勞力工作更適合我一點……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1642_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太陽好像快下山了，我也該回家了，家裡還有一堆破爛要收拾呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1642_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再見！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1642_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "突然想起來，我們見了那麼多回，我還不知道大哥叫什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寡言的棋士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姓蘭，名可，梅蘭的蘭，可否的可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1642_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我的名字，大哥記得住吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛勤？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1642_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1642_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我真的走囉，娘親說我們要搬出去住一陣，等我回來了，一定會再來看你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1642_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再見！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "步聲漸遠，夜色落在棋盤上，月光照亮棋子，雨雪洗淨石椅。\n蘭可拿起一枚白子，正要落子，卻又收回，摩挲了半天，最終擲回棋罐。\n第十個死局了，他記得很清楚。\n又是一盤算計，這一次，他得想個得勝的奇招。\n……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "63_mini01_market"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禮貌的先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1638_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雲先生，在下就送您到這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您之前不是說，那位在山上等我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禮貌的先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1638_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正是正是，那一位此時確實在山上，而我的任務，只是將您送至這條山路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禮貌的先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1638_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從此處上山只有一條路，也並不難走，周邊的林子都清理過，不會有猛獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禮貌的先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1638_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您只管向上走，其餘的都為您安排好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那要是繼續追問，反而顯得我不懂禮數了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，就此別過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禮貌的先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1638_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再會了，雲先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "話是這麼說，可是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這哪裡有進山的路啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "地上積葉厚重，怕是許久沒人從此處登山了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且連條獸道都沒有……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許我該找位當地人問下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "徬徨的姑娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姑娘，您好，有什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "徬徨的姑娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問，您有沒有見過我家郎君？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "徬徨的姑娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他年紀不大，有著頭棕髮，尾尖全白，穿著雲衫土褲皮靴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我好像……沒有見過這樣的人，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "徬徨的姑娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣啊……耽誤您的時間了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請留步，姑娘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是這裡的人吧？我想請問一下，這附近，是否有上山的路？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "徬徨的姑娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您要上山？那您應該是找錯路啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "徬徨的姑娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上山的正道在小鎮另一頭，這裡是後山，又陡又險，鎮民們都很少從此上山。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（後山？我明明是從大道一路直行過來的，怎麼來到了後山？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來是這樣嗎……多謝姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我想……既然為我引路的那位先生留下話讓我朝這個方向走，一定也有他的思量，我還是準備試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告辭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "徬徨的姑娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "徬徨的姑娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，我與您一起上山吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位姑娘，您怎麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "徬徨的姑娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "山上路險，我們兩人結伴，也能互相有個照應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "徬徨的姑娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且……鎮裡能問的地方我都問了個遍，這地界也就山上還沒尋過了。若郎君還在此處，也只能在這山中了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，多謝姑娘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知姑娘怎麼稱呼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "徬徨的姑娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……白錦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g08_pavilion"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛勤",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘭大哥，這盤棋，你還是沒頭緒嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不急，不急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛勤",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都過去這麼久了，我都學會下棋了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛勤",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這盤棋上的局面，是不是叫“三劫循環”？按規則是和棋吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和棋……和棋是不行的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和那人說好了，只有贏了這盤棋，他才能幫我實現願望……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，我必須要找到勝法……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛勤",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1627_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你到底有什麼願望這麼要緊，非要藉由下這盤棋實現？就沒有別的辦法了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別的辦法……哪裡有別的辦法……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有什麼辦法……能讓陰陽兩隔的人再見一面……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "劫數……究竟是從哪裡來的劫數……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錦兒，這樣就行了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真好看！郎君手真巧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還以為你燒瓷的手藝，只會用來燒棋子呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿……我會的還很多，以後你想要的、喜歡的，我都可以燒給你看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等我們正式成婚了，這個瓷瓶就放在客廳最顯眼的位置吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“東瓶西鏡，終生平靜”……客廳裡還差面鏡子。可是這樣一來，鐘就放不下了。不過鎮上那口鐘，每天朝暮都要敲一通，也算有啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到時候瓶子裡可以插些花，鏡子裡照著一個你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別鬧了……家裡的柴火不多了，趁天色還早，你再去後山上砍一點吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那你等我一下，我馬上回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，等你回來，晚飯差不多就燒好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是……怎麼回事……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些怪物，都是從哪裡跑來的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錦兒————！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g06_mountainroad_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來……這裡真的……有路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白姑娘……需要幫忙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不勞您費心，雲先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也是山野裡長大的人，這點路算不了什麼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒是您面色似乎不太好，要休息一會嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就……歇息一會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼……哈……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您這副執著的樣子，真是和我的郎君一個模樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姑娘的郎君，應該是一個認真的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他這個人啊，做什麼都一根筋，很少有人能勸得動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不吃不喝不動釘在那裡直到成事，唉，真是又惹人憐又惹人厭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說的話，他還算聽得進去，所以每次都是我扭著他耳朵把他帶回來，從小就這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過鎮上有圍棋先生，說他的個性就適合學棋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓他學習幾年，說不定也能成一方高手，甚至是國手，到時候他就能走出這座小鎮，去更遠的地方看看啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的郎君，去學下棋了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……他學了很久呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "學到一門心思全投入進去，經常別人說什麼話也不聽，真過分呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈……我也聽說，圍棋黑白縱橫之道奧妙無窮，引人入勝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大地寬廣如斯，總有讓人深陷其中的事與物，甚至一個念想，都能讓人陷入其中徬徨許久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的郎君執著於此，也總有他的道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼幫他辯解起來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是有感而發……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了……姑娘，您說您的郎君不見了，他究竟是何時不見的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有天傍晚，他說要去山上打點柴，在那之後就再也沒有了音信……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這的確令人著急……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白姑娘，我們這就啟程吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不需要再坐會嗎？您的身子看起來不算強壯，平時應該也鮮少走這麼陡的山路吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖說不能施展武功，但呼吸吐納之法，卻是日常都在練的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "山路還長，我也應當勤勉些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看那座山頭上好像有座古亭，我們到了那裡再歇息一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g08_pavilion"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這盤棋，還是膠著在這啊……這一手，又想了多久喲……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘭大哥，這都過多久了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我那孫兒啊，都有我當初那麼高了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和他講你的事，他還滿臉不相信，說哪有人能花一輩子的時間，只為一盤破棋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘭大哥啊，你還記得，你和白姐姐是什麼時候分開的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不記得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鎮上出事後，我心灰意冷，在山裡徬徨了幾個月，而後來到這裡，應當沒有太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是什麼時日？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些記不太清了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你知道，現在是什麼時日嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但那不重要，先等我解完棋局，其他的事，之後再說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，現在鎮裡的人都在為了那個什麼寶貝忙得團團轉，沒想到還有人會來這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年輕人，你也是來看這場棋局的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們只是路過歇息一下……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們？小兄弟你不是一個人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個人？剛剛和我一同登山的那位姑娘……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪……剛剛明明還在的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雲青萍環顧四周，哪裡還有半分女子的身影。\n只有一個沉默寡言的少年，對著一方紋枰枯坐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位兄台是……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，這位大哥陷在棋裡出不來啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是懂棋的話，就幫幫他吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這棋局……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三劫循環，若是一直爭，就只有和棋一個結局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這位大哥，卻硬是想要爭個勝負，到頭來把自己困在了這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也沒什麼辦法……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（觀摩棋局）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（沉思）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完，完啦，又陷進去一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一個個的，唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不為和，只求勝……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若是心思只在劫上，真能爭出個勝負嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g11_yumendesert"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個孩子……竟然還活著……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這麼重的傷，他將來還要受多少罪……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g8_yumenarena"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這身子，根本練不了武，便是記了天下的武功，又有什麼用處？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老師，我不明白……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g2_desertedcityfield_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雲兄，你就沒有質疑過宗師的安排嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有總是有的，最初接過這差事，肚子裡也有些怨氣，覺得讓我這樣的人天天看著大家習武，就像是把我鎖在柱上又在眼前放了塊肉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聞著香，看著饞，卻又吃不了半口，牢騷折磨不停，難受得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然而你現在卻沒半點受苦的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便只是理論上的精進，也多少能讓人心裡寬慰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但更重要的——我想我應當是明白了些事理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有沒有和左兄提起過最近的夢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不妨說來聽聽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有一晚夢到今後歸於田野，藉藉無名。那招招式式，落在田裡農事上，運氣提勁，割草鋤地，來來回回，也就多省半分力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而另一晚則是轟轟烈烈，快意恩仇，效仿老師的模樣，勁發江潮落，氣收秋毫平。一拳打出個傳奇，而後氣盡而亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這兩者聽起來都和現在的雲兄相去甚遠……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "執念如泥潭，陷在其中，當然看不透。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "思來想去，只有一個答案……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g08_pavilion"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先捨，再看，後得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一手棋，應該下在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雲青萍捻起一顆白子，沒有顧及棋盤上那百目對殺，輕描淡寫地落在了另一側。\n黑棋乘勢消滅了棋盤上的大片白棋，在一番驚天轉換後，竟然是白棋簡明優勢的局面。\n蘭可呆呆地看著棋盤上那看了千萬遍的黑白棋子，如泡影般消失在眼前，只留下一副乾淨棋盤，還有三個人。\n棋局，破了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "竟然……還有這樣的手段！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多謝這位小兄弟！我想了好久都沒有眉目，沒想到你一來就能把它破開，在下實在是佩服！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過獎了，我於棋道並不算精通。只是想著世上萬物道理相通，有捨有得的武道應當也能用在棋道上，沒想到歪打正著了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生的棋力應該遠勝在下，但因為太執著於這劫爭的勝負，反而錯過了全局的解法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎麼說，這殘局總算解開了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是……洛勤？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是洛勤的孫子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爺爺生前總念叨著老家山上下棋的怪人，我也來了好多次，原本還想把這裡的事託付給我孫子的，沒想到是這個小兄弟了結了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那豈不是已經過了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一百多年吧，這個小鎮也都變樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "竟然已經……與錦兒分開了這麼多時日……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "郎君。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錦兒？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，是我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "郎君……好久不見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是真的！那位仙人沒有騙我！我真的見到你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了，真的……太好了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們回家吧！爹娘還在等我們呢——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白錦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1873_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錦兒……？你怎麼，不說話……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來……哈哈哈……原來是這樣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我竟然……也早已……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘭可",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1868_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎麼說，我也算，再見到你了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "棋局已破，仙人實現了他的諾言。\n於是，蘭可再無遺憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“白錦”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1872_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白姑娘……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對……你並不是故事裡的那個白姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“白錦”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1872_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是了，見到了郎君，我還能有什麼念想呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“白錦”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1872_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也只是她衣冠塚前的一疊紙錢，浸透了他的眼淚和思念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“白錦”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1872_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的願望，我的命數，都繫在與郎君相會上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“白錦”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1872_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他走了，我也沒有留在這裡的理由了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“白錦”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1872_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煩請兩位圓我最後一個念想，請將郎君的塚設在她的衣冠塚邊，並在那燒了“我”吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“白錦”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1872_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今生雖沒有一起終老的福分，但願來世……還能再會……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "說罷，“白姑娘”長揖到地。一眨眼過後——\n便只剩下了一疊紙錢在風中微顫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "紙錢……難道這位白錦姑娘，是倀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一百二十年前的一個晚上，不知為什麼，這座小鎮中突然湧入了大量的倀怪，大肆傷人，那當真是一場浩劫啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的爺爺，被那位名叫蘭可的少年人救了下來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那天晚上，那位少年在鎮上幫助了許多人逃生……而他自己，則被那位白錦姑娘從倀怪的洪流中拖了出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白錦姑娘……自己卻死在了那天晚上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘭先生與白姑娘，都是善良的人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說那些倀怪啊，都是從意念中生出的，那念想要是沒了，就會重新變回物品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們家傳了三代的秘辛算是有結果了，但我的老淚怎麼就停不住呢……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小兄弟，我要下山了，白姐姐吩咐的事，我這老頭總得把它做好，也好給爺爺一個交代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "山上有人要見我，我得趕過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，現在山上很熱鬧的，不知道是什麼大人物特地要你從後山跑一趟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我就先走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1639_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若是還有緣再會，歡迎來我家喝茶啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老洛小心收拾好地上的物品，放在竹簍裡，搖搖晃晃下了山。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你破開了棋局嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問您是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "應付瑣事的半身，當我是個苦力倀就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是大……重岳身邊負責記錄的人類吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想必您也是歲獸代理人中的一位了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉以這種方式把你請來，上山吧，有客人在山頂等你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以“請”我來的……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正是。本來是為了一些別的事情……但沒想到你這一遭，還順便把這局棋給破了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（大聲）又讓你算準了，開心嗎，臭棋簍子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "破這棋局純屬巧合，怎會是他人的籌謀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當初二哥在這裡留下棋局的時候，就說將來只有真正有慧根的人類才能破局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在想想，他特地將棋局布在此處——兄弟姐妹裡最接近“人身”的，也就大哥他一個，引他教出的徒弟過來……這一手也算不得奇手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們上山吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走的時候記得把棋盤帶上，棋已下完，現在它是你的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "63_mini04_mountaintop"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知該如何稱呼您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "單字一個梁，橫梁的梁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁先生，方才您說只有老師的學生才能破此局。然而這棋局在我之前就有人在下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說那個蘭可？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1870_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當初那位確實有允諾，留了他在此處下棋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerId": "avg_4196_reckpr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這局棋分明是越執著於劫，就越沒破局的可能。明知棋手會執著於此，卻仍讓他入了局……"
